@startuml sequence_live_invalidation
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Daily Results - Live invalidation flow

actor User
participant "Activity Page" as AP
participant "API" as API
participant "EventBus" as EB
participant "Notifier" as N
participant "SignalR" as SR
participant "Invalidations$" as IS
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C

User -> AP: Record activity
AP -> API: POST /activity
API -> EB: ActivityRecordedEvent
EB -> N: subscriber
N -> SR: dashboardTileDataInvalidated\n[dailyResults]
SR -> IS: emit
IS -> T: bindTileMode wakes
T -> C: load('live', null)
C -> API: GET /commitment/daily-results
API --> C: { completed: 8, total: 9 }
C --> T: signal updates
T --> User: Body re-renders 8 / 9

@enduml
